Package: surtvirtualrwandarepro
Type: Project
Title: Auditable District-Scale Earth-Data Harmonization and Provenance Labelling
Version: 1.2.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Audre Prince", "Tuyishime", role = c("aut", "cre"),
                  comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0002-0799-3140"))
Description: Reproducible preparation of district-level rainfall, temperature,
    vegetation-greenness, and terrain layers for Rwanda, together with a
    fail-closed provenance-labelling contract, controlled transformation
    fixtures, failure-injection tests, geometry-agnostic portability checks,
    independent GeoJSON release-contract validation, and scoped public CHIRPS
    numerical reproduction. This is an unreleased development candidate based
    on the published version 1.1.1 archive.
